 Game.lean                                               | 2 +-
 Game/LevelLemmas/settheory.lean                         | 3 +--
 Game/LevelLemmas/settheory_knightsknavesfoundation.lean | 3 +--
 Game/Levels/SetTheory_Knights_Knaves/L09_same.lean      | 2 +-
 Game/MathlibTheorems.lean                               | 2 +-
 5 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

